modern trash bins improve waste management efficiency?\n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <p>\n                    With the advanced and smart trash bin suppliers in Oman, the bins now feature fill-level sensors\n                    that let the collection teams know when the bin is full, thereby avoiding unnecessary collection and\n                    saving fuel. This technology is increasingly being implemented in smart city projects in the\n                    Sultanate.\n\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n            <div>Are pedal-operated trash bins better for hygiene?\n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <p>\n                    Yes, pedal-operated bins are hands-free, thus reducing the need for hand contact and risk of\n                    cross-contamination in healthcare and food environments. A variety of pedal bins available to suit a\n                    hospital, hotel or commercial kitchen\'s hygiene demands. If you are looking for waste bins suppliers\n                    in Oman, we are here for you.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n            <div>What are the key features to look for in industrial waste bins? </div>\n            <div>\n                <p>\n                    Strong HDPE material, large capacity (up to 1100L), UV protection and wheels for ease of movement\n                    are the most important features in waste bins Oman. As one of the leading waste bins suppliers in\n                    Oman, we have designed our bins to be extremely resistant to tough industrial environments and easy\n                    to maintain.\n\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n            <div>Which trash bins are suitable for hospitals and healthcare facilities?\n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <p>\n                    Pedal operated or sensor bins are required in healthcare areas to minimize contact and ensure\n                    correct disposal of medical waste while minimizing the spread of germs. We are one of the trusted\n                    trash bin suppliers in Oman and provide medical grade bins which comply with infection control\n                    standards.\n\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n            <div>\n                How can businesses reduce waste management costs with proper bins? </div>\n            <div>\n                <p>\n                    As one of the leading waste bin suppliers in Oman, choose the right size and type of waste bin for\n                    the space you have available, which means that you will not have to worry about any waste bins\n                    spilling over, and you will not need to clean them as frequently as you otherwise would. We can\n                    assist businesses to choose the optimum bin collection to make waste management more economical and\n                    efficient.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n            <div>\n                What are the most popular recycling bins suppliers in Oman?\n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <p>\n                    Feel free to buy ready-to-use bins for your business that have been color-coded and labeled for easy\n                    sorting by employees and visitors. We are one of the most trusted waste bins suppliers Oman that\n                    provide complete sets of waste bins to offices, malls and public areas.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>','/imported-blogs/a11d188d8ed950b0fa20.jpg','Best Trash Bin Suppliers in Oman for Commercial, Industrial, and Residential Needs','Hygiene Links','Cleaning &amp; Hygiene','','2026-05-21 00:00:00','published',0,110,'2026-10-22 12:38:13','2026-10-22 12:38:13'),('blog-cfe48f7eee48b8a3c6bdac5e','2026-cleaning-industry-trends-sustainable-products-smart-dispensers-and-automation','2026-cleaning-industry-trends-sustainable-products-smart-dispensers-and-automation','https://hygienelinks.com/blog/details/2026-cleaning-industry-trends-sustainable-products-smart-dispensers-and-automation.html','c2ca29fb0ac1b1aebd49a13c8b6c4b362d35b74d6c457418dabaca13bf67063f','2026 Cleaning Industry Trends: Sustainable Products, Smart Dispensers, and Automation','The era of viewing as a background function industry is undergoing One of its most significant transformations in decades. Fueled by post-pandemic hygiene awareness , stricter sustainability mandates, rapid technological innovation, and the UAE\'s ambitious green economy agenda…','<p>\n	<span><span>The  era of viewing  as a background function industry is undergoing One of its most significant transformations in decades. Fueled by post-pandemic hygiene awareness , stricter sustainability mandates, rapid technological innovation, and the UAE\'s ambitious green economy agenda, cleaning materials suppliers in Dubai and across the wider UAE are rapidly evolving their product lines and service models to meet a rapidly evolving market. For facility managers, procurement leads and corporate owners , 2026 is a remarkable year where these trends are originally redefining what responsible, high standard cleaning looks like.</span></span></p><p>\n	<span><span>For facility managers, procurement professionals, and business owners seeking to understand where the industry is heading, 2026 presents a pivotal moment in which several converging trends are reshaping what effective, responsible cleaning  strategies . The days when cleaning was an invisible background function are over. In today\'s commercial landscape , hygiene standards are visible, measurable metric , and one that directly influences how a business is acquired by its clients , regulators , and internal sustainability surveys.</span></span></p><p>\n	<span><span>The UAE\'s drive towards to be recognized as a global leader in sustainability — articulated through the Net Zero 2050 target and the comprehensive National Climate plan have accelerated — has added regulatory and reputation momentum to sustainability trends that were already building commercially. Suppliers who recognized this change early are now perfectly placed to help clients navigating through this current transition.Cleaning materials suppliers in UAE who have anticipated this direction are now well positioned to support clients through a meaningful transition in how facility cleaning is specified, procured, and delivered.Whether you are managing a large-scale facility in Dubai or sourcing reliable equipment from </span><a href=\"https://www.hygienelinks.com/\"><span>cleaning materials suppliers in dubai</span></a><span>, the focus has aligned toward solutions that are as sustainable as they are cost effective -  it is recommended for anyone looking to stay ahead over time in an fast moving . competitive and conscious market</span></span></p><h2>\n	<span><span>Sustainability at the Centre of Procurement Decisions</span></span></h2><p>\n	<span><span>Perhaps the most impact shift in cleaning products suppliers in Dubai\'s market is the definitive move toward eco -friendly formulations and  sustainable packaging. Thanks to stricter UAE environmental  regulations, and a growing commitment to green practice combined with increasing environmental awareness among corporate clients and hospitality groups. “green credentials”  are no longer just a nice to have entity or marketing feature  - they are now treated as the standard requirement for the procurement.</span></span></p><p>\n	<span><span>Suppliers in the city are meeting this demand with highly concentrated cleaning solutions that reduce packaging waste and transportation emissions. By using a concentrated cleaning product that dilutes at a ratio of one part product to two hundred parts water drastically cut down the packaging waste and lower carbon emissions and  generates less waste, and costs significantly less to transport per effective cleaning dose than a ready-to-use formulation. When you look at the total aanual consumption of a large facility   the difference in packaging waste, transport emissions, and storage space required , and of course the environmental impact are massive.</span></span></p><p>\n	<span><span>We are also seeing a major switch to Biodegradable surfactant — these plant based active cleaning agents in most cleaning formulations — are quickly replacing conventional petrochemical-derived ingredients . While older eco friendly versions of biodegradable surfactant sometimes struggled to get the job done in cleaning efficacy, modern green chemistry have created formulations that match or exceed the performance of their old school chemicals . Cleaning products suppliers in UAE who have embraced in these innovation updates are now provide  Eco-certified  earth safe products that don’t sacrifice on the cleaning performance that facility managers need .</span></span></p><p>\n	<span><span>Furthermore Refillable and reusable packaging systems are becoming the new  standard practice in the UAE\'s premium facility management space . Instead of buying constant supplies of cleaning products in single-use plastic containers , facilities receive concentrated refill pouches or use on-site dilution stations that portion product accurately at the time of use. For large-scale facility operators like  hotels, hospitals, shopping malls, and office complexes — the shift toward sustainable cleaning products suppliers in UAE is a win --win as it is financially and environmentally motivated, two arguments that together make the case irresistible. It is an wise decision for anyone , much like those looking for reliable Tissue Dispenser Suppliers in Muscat , Oman to streamline their operational structures.</span></span></p><h2>\n	<span><span>Smart Dispensers and the Internet of Hygiene Things</span></span></h2><p>\n	<span><span>The rise of Io T-connected hygiene dispensers is revolutionizing how cleaning supplies for cleaning services are managed in busy  environments.In the past  traditional washroom and sanitation dispenser management relying on manual physical inspection rounds conducted by cleaning staff at regular intervals — which often  resulted in empty dispensers during busy hours and cleaning staff spending disproportionate time on rounds rather than active regular cleaning .</span></span></p><p>\n	<br />\n	<span><span>Smart  sensor equipped dispensers with fill-level sensors have changed the  game by communicating remotely with facility management platforms, These devices offer real time insights by triggering automated restocking requests and providing facility managers with consideration  into consumable usage across all dispenser units.  For instance,When a hand soap dispenser in a busy airport terminal drops to twenty percent capacity, the system generates an alert. If a paper towel dispenser is nearing empty during the busy hours , the system alerts the cleaning staff  and are directed there before the dispenser runs out rather than after. This proactive approach in user experience — and in the impression of facility standards that users take away — is meaningful and upholds its professional standards.</span></span></p><p>\n	<span><span>Cleaning equipment suppliers across UAE are increasingly incorporating sensor-equipped dispensers for soap, sanitizer , tissue, and paper towels into their standard product inventory . These connected products not only improve the end-user experience  and moreover it generate usage data that enables facilities managers to identify high-traffic zones, optimize their supply orders  , and provide clear proof of  their hygiene compliance to regulatory bodies and prominent clients.</span></span></p><p>\n	<span><span>In sectors with  hospitality and healthcare ,this  smart dispenser integration is quickly becoming the default for new projects , from pilot to standard specification in new facility builds. The operational wins  — such as saving staff time on routine rounds, elimination of dispenser outages, accurate consumption data for better procurement — justify the capital investment in sensor-enabled hardware over a very short payback period. Cleaning products suppliers in Dubai or </span><a href=\"https://www.hygienelinks.com/\"><span>cleaning materials suppliers in dubai</span></a><span> who offer smart dispensing solutions as part of their product portfolio are stepping out to meet a modern demands of facility management</span></span></p><h2>\n	<span><span>Automation and Robotics in Commercial Cleaning</span></span></h2><p>\n	<span><span>Floor cleaning robots have gone from gimmicks to being put into use at the largest business facilities of Dubai and Abu Dhabi. Robotic scrubbers that can navigate themselves around open spaces by detecting obstacles via LiDAR technology and following pre-mapped floor maps are now employed in airports, shopping centers, and hospitals with increasing accuracy.</span></span></p><p>\n	<span><span>Robotized window cleaners help address one of the most dangerous and costly procedures for high-rise buildings in the UAE: window glass cleaning from the outside. These robots move along the facade of high-rise buildings either vacuuming their surfaces or walking along guide cables, thereby reducing the danger of injury to the employees as well as cutting down costs of accessing the windows.</span></span></p><p>\n	<span><span>UV disinfection robots, which sterilize rooms independently of any human intervention, have made the move from a temporary measure in times of pandemic to regular infection prevention equipment in hospitals, clinics, and manufacturing plants. Their capacity to guarantee effective room-wide disinfection not dependent on the performance of individual employees is an invaluable innovation in this area.</span></span></p><p>\n	<span><span>For cleaning materials suppliers in UAE, this  surge in automation trend creates significant market  opportunities. Automated cleaning machines  are highly sophisticated , they require specialized  chemical formulations designed for machine-dispensed application, where precise concentration control, material compatibility with machine components, and low-foaming properties are critical - engineered for precision  . Cleaning products suppliers in Dubai who develop or source product lines created specifically for automated delivery systems are positioning themselves advantageously in a market segment with strong and sustained growth momentum. By focusing on these high performance machine compatible formulations ,suppliers can secure a competitive edge in a  section that is experiencing sustainable , robust growth.</span></span></p><p>\n	<span><span>Just as the industry depends on the  precision in automation, corporate across the region—including those working with </span><a href=\"https://www.hygienelinks.com/\"><span>cleaning materials suppliers in dubai</span></a><span>—are finding that the key to modern facility management workflow  is choosing partners who understand the technical intersection of technology, chemistry, and operational reliability with an extensive industrial experience .</span></span></p><h2>\n	<span><span>Hygiene Standards Post-Pandemic: A Permanently Elevated Baseline</span></span></h2><p>\n	<span><span>The COVID-19 pandemic permanently shifted how public expectations around cleanliness in shared spaces, and  these heightened expectations are here to stay . Today though surface sanitation, air quality management, and visible hygiene protocols are considered standard requirement rather than premium extra perks across hospitality, retail, healthcare, and education sectors. Guests and visitors have become the more observant ,they can easily spot intensive cleaning regimes of 2020 and 2021 now notice when those standards slip, and they have learned to distinguish genuine hygiene practice from cosmetic “tidiness”.</span></span></p><p>\n	<span><span>This change in mindset has led to a sustained demand for a variety of specialized for cleaning chemical suppliers in UAE products — Items tht wre once reserved for clinical environment  such as  hospital-grade surface disinfectants, air sanitizers, hand hygiene chemicals , and antimicrobial surface coatings — that were niche or specialized before the pandemic. Products that were once purchased only by healthcare facilities are now standard items in hotel cleaning contracts, school procurement, and corporate facility management budgets in today’s era .</span></span></p><p>\n	<span><span>Cleaning supplies for cleaning services now regularly include product categories that barely existed in standard contracts a decade ago. Professional cleaning companies and in-house facilities teams alike have expanded their chemical inventories , creating a great opportunity for cleaning products suppliers in UAE who can offer diverse ranges with consistent performance in supply chain reliability. The ability to supply the full spectrum of cleaning and disinfection products from a single suppliers simplify the procurement process and ensure all products work perfectly together. Whether a client is looking for high-end chemicals in Dubai or scouting reliable </span><a href=\"https://www.hygienelinks.com/\"><span>cleaning product suppliers in dubai </span></a><span>they are increasingly looking for partners who can deliver consistency, technical expertise, and a complete supply chain solution.</span></span></p><h2>\n	<span><span>Hygiene Link UAE: Your Comprehensive Cleaning Supplies Partner</span></span></h2><p>\n	<span><span>At Hygiene Link, we serve as a one-stop solution for all the cleaning supplies available across the Emirates of Dubai and United Arab Emirates (UAE). We offer a wide variety of chemical compounds, heavy duty cleaning devices, and dispensers that can cope with the needs of a rapidly changing market. The company aims to incorporate the latest developments in its line, such as green-certified concentrates and reduced plastic consumption to IoT-powered dispensing units and machine-specific liquid cleaning solutions.</span></span></p><p>\n	<br />\n	<span><span>Depending on the client\'s needs, Hygiene Link provides a wide selection of products suitable for environmentally safe and compliant chemical cleaners, dispensers that are designed with sensors in mind, and durable industrial cleaning equipment.</span></span></p><p>\n	<br />\n	<span><span>Choosing cleaning products for your establishment can never be an easy choice and depends not only on pricing. Other factors include chemical compound compatibility, regulatory compliance, training of the staff in using such substances, and ensuring continuous product delivery. That\'s why at Hygiene Link, we do not consider ourselves just another supplier but aim to become a full-fledged business partner for our clients..</span></span></p><p>\n	<span><span>For organizations seeking a professional cleaning products supplier partner in UAE that ready for the modern demands of 2026\'s facility management landscape, Hygiene Link offers a relationship approach that goes far  beyond a simple product transaction. We also bridge the gap for regional requirements , serving as a vital point of contact whether you need solutions in Dubai or are looking for expert </span><a href=\"https://www.hygienelinks.com/\"><span>cleaning product suppliers in dubai</span></a><span> Visit </span><a href=\"https://www.hygienelinks.com\"><span>www.hygienelinks.com</span></a><span> to browse our catalog and start a conversation with our team.</span></span></p>','/imported-blogs/11fba63b9c48c791660a.jpg','2026 Cleaning Industry Trends: Sustainable Products, Smart Dispensers, and Automation','Hygiene Links','Cleaning &amp; Hygiene','','2026-07-15 00:00:00','published',0,30,'2026-10-22 12:38:13','2026-10-22 12:38:13'),('blog-d98b688c712d2c303db271b0','10-tips-for-getting-the-best-shine-from-your-furniture-polish','10-tips-for-getting-the-best-shine-from-your-furniture-polish','https://hygienelinks.com/blog/details/10-tips-for-getting-the-best-shine-from-your-furniture-polish.html','f7ef87376cbc5988a1adb2d61c796619d94a373e631ca9a4cafe98f6e9bdfb1e','10 Tips For Getting the Best Shine from your Furniture Polish','Enhance the shine of your furniture with these 10 expert tips. Discover how to get the best results from your furniture polish for a stunning finish.','<div>\n	Furniture, especially wooden furniture, matures gracefully but may start to lose its lustre and freshness as it does. Consequently, it is crucial to keep it oiled in order to preserve its brilliance. Your wooden furniture will appear better and stay in better condition if you regularly wax or oil it. </div><div>\n	 </div><div>\n	The same goes for our wooden furniture as it does for us when it comes to grooming.  Being one of the best <a href=\"https://www.hygienelinks.com/furniture-polish-details.html\">Furniture Polish Suppliers in Dubai, UAE</a>, today here in this blog will cover some tips on how to make your furniture shine more.</div><div>\n	 </div><div>\n	<strong>•<span> </span>Equipment and Material</strong></div><div>\n	 </div><div>\n	You will require a robust brush or a vacuum cleaner. Obtain some fresh, clean, and unused cleaning rags. The most efficient cleaning is done with microfiber towels. </div><div>\n	 </div><div>\n	Grab a bucket with a capacity of 5 litres of water right away. White vinegar is a powerful green cleaning ingredient for everyday cleaning. Use olive or vegetable oil to polish the furniture if it needs it.</div><div>\n	 </div><div>\n	<strong>•<span> </span>Create Space</strong></div><div>\n	 </div><div>\n	Get free access to surfaces made of wood. Remove any embellishments, such as knobs, unless they are necessary to hold the furniture together, such as hinges. Counter and tabletops made of clear wood. </div><div>\n	 </div><div>\n	Remove the pillows, mattresses, and bedsheets if it\'s a bed or sofa set. To create extra workspace, now move the furniture away from the wall.</div><div>\n	 </div><div>\n	<strong>•<span> </span>Dust Off</strong></div><div>\n	 </div><div>\n	To get rid of dust and collected debris from the surface, corners, and cracks, use the brush attachment of the vacuum cleaner or a soft manual brush. </div><div>\n	 </div><div>\n	Rub the surface with a wet towel if you choose. Dust the cushions, pillows, and mattresses while you\'re at it.</div><div>\n	 </div><div>\n	<strong>•<span> </span>Clean</strong></div><div>\n	 </div><div>\n	2 litres of warm water and half a cup of white vinegar should be combined. For bigger areas, the ingredients could be doubled. Now, dunk a rag in the water and completely wring it out. </div><div>\n	 </div><div>\n	You don\'t want the wood finish to be damaged by too much water. Gently scrub the surfaces in a circular motion. When the cloth becomes dirty, rinse it, then repeat the process until the entire item is clean.</div><div>\n	 </div><div>\n	<strong>•<span> </span>Remove Moisture</strong></div><div>\n	 </div><div>\n	Buff surfaces with a clean, dry cloth. To achieve a dazzling finish, repeat the circular motion. Repeat the wash procedure for any spots that are not as clean as you would want. The wood should be clean and dry after this procedure.</div><div>\n	 </div><div>\n	<strong>•<span> </span>Polish</strong></div><div>\n	 </div><div>\n	Once or twice a year, give wood a good polishing to maintain its quality. <a href=\"https://www.hygienelinks.com/furniture-polish-details.html\">Furniture Polish Suppliers in Dubai, UAE</a> provide some of the best furniture polishes that are sure to bring the extra shine in the items. You can also mix one-fourth cup of vegetable or olive oil with an equal amount of white vinegar. </div><div>\n	 </div><div>\n	Use the mixture to dampen a microfiber cloth as you polish the wood until it shines. To ensure that the liquid is operating as it should and is not in any way harming your furniture, test a small area.</div><div>\n	 </div><div>\n	<strong>•<span> </span>Keep Wooden Furniture in Safe Places</strong></div><div>\n	 </div><div>\n	By safe places, we mean locations where the furniture can be kept in good weather. To put it another way, it is best if you keep the wooden furniture out of the sun. </div><div>\n	 </div><div>\n	In the event that this is not feasible, make an effort to reduce its exposure to the sun\'s direct rays. Additionally, it would be wise to keep the furniture away from regions that are excessively humid since this could cause cracks in the pieces.</div><div>\n	 </div><h2>\n	Conclusion</h2><div>\n	 </div><div>\n	We all enjoy sleek, space-saving furniture, particularly when it is custom-made. But as you are aware, cleaning furniture can be very difficult, particularly when it comes to household furniture. </div><div>\n	 </div><div>\n	Fortunately, there are such better methods for maintaining clean and shining hardwood furniture. Make sure you have all the necessary cleaning tools from the <a href=\"https://www.hygienelinks.com/products/cleaning-chemicals.html\">cleaning materials suppliers in Dubai, UAE</a>, on hand before beginning the cleaning of your furniture.</div>','/imported-blogs/c2f8d69db0c5bb688109.jpg','10 Tips For Getting the Best Shine from your Furniture Polish','Hygiene Links','Cleaning &amp; Hygiene','','2024-12-05 00:00:00','published',0,690,'2026-10-22 12:38:13','2026-10-22 12:38:13'),('blog-dbb118cba343057d7dee6da6','how-to-make-a-substantial-saving-on-your-garbage-bag-spends','how-to-make-a-substantial-saving-on-your-garbage-bag-spends','https://hygienelinks.com/blog/details/how-to-make-a-substantial-saving-on-your-garbage-bag-spends.html','6b21478fabbd8380d740727ed469921eaf0bcb977be6ff0633164af8f4921d09','How to make a substantial saving on your garbage bag spends','Tired of overspending on garbage bags? Discover practical tips to significantly reduce your garbage bag costs!','<div>\n	<p>\n		<span><span><span>Plastic garbage and trash bags are used across the globe due to its versatility and it is almost impossible to do without it. Unfortunately, plastic has adverse effects on the environment and we are forced to look for cost effective alternatives for it. If you company requires the use of plastic bags and you are looking for a cost effective substitute, read to know how to make a substantial saving on your garbage bag spends.</span></span></span></p>\n	\n	<p>\n		<span><span><strong><span>The Nitty-Gritties Of Recycled Bags</span></strong></span></span></p>\n	<p>\n		<span><span><span>So what is the alternative to this? Most of us think it is recycled plastic bags. While this is a good option, especially for the environment, recycled bags are not exactly cost effective. They are manufactured from used/reused congregated plastic waste. Cleaning and preparing used plastics takes a lot of water, energy, and effort.</span></span></span></p>\n	<p>\n		<span><span><span>Additionally, as they are made out of plastic waste, to maintain their agility and strength, it is necessary to keep their thickness at more than 60 microns. As a result, the recycled plastic bag gains about 50% more weight than those of virgin bags.</span></span></span></p>\n	<p>\n		<span><span><span><strong>The Other Hindrances of Recycled Bags</strong></span></span></span></p>\n	<ul>\n		<li>\n			<span>*<span>Strength is substantially lesser than virgin bags</span></span></li>\n		<li>\n			<span><span>* Generates unpleasant odor</span></span></li>\n		<li>\n			<span><span>* Less durable and lesser shelf life than virgin bags</span></span></li>\n		<li>\n			<span><span>* Needs more space for storage</span></span></li>\n		<li>\n			<span><span>* Poses inconvenience while transporting</span></span></li>\n		<li>\n			<span><span>* Do not meet the established hygiene standards</span></span></li>\n		<li>\n			<span><span>* They are legally banned in most cities as they are non-biodegradable</span></span></li>\n		<li>\n			<span><span>* These bags, generally  can be produced in black color only</span></span></li>\n	</ul>\n	<p>\n		<span><span><strong>Oxo Bio-Degradable Bags To The Rescue</strong></span></span></p>\n	<p>\n		<span><span><span><strong>If recycled plastic bags are out of the equation, what is to be used? The simple solution is using Oxo bio-degradable garbage bags.</strong></span></span></span></p>\n	<p>\n		<span><span><span><strong>An Overview Of Oxo Bio-degradable Garbage Bags</strong></span></span></span></p>\n	<p>\n		<span><span><span>Oxo-bio degradable bags are a technically advanced and innovative range of product that is environmental friendly. These bags are manufactured from polymers like HDPE, LDPE and LLDPE, which degrade quickly making them environment friendly as well.</span></span></span></p>\n	<p>\n		<span><span><span>Apart from the environmental benefits, these bags are also cost effective. By adding specific ingredients and basic polymer, plastic bags can easily be converted into Oxo bio-degradable ones, providing a safer and cost effective solution. They can also be made with the same machine and workforce of a virgin plastic bag.</span></span></span></p>\n	<p>\n		<span><span><span>Since they are made of raw ingredients, it is possible to maintain the strength of the bags. In fact, there is no difference in quality, texture, or strength between regular and Oxo-biodegradable plastic. However, recycled plastic bags, do not provide this with Oxo bio-degradable bags, it is even possible to customize the thickness of the bags as per the individual’s needs.</span></span></span></p>\n	<p>\n		<span><span><span><strong>Advantages of Oxo-Biodegradable Bags</strong></span></span></span></p>\n	<ul>\n		<li>\n			<span><span>* The strength factor is consistent and these bags are highly dependable</span></span></li>\n		<li>\n			<span><span>* They do