INSERT INTO `catalog_editorials` VALUES ('category:aerosol-products','category','aerosol-products','Aerosol Products','[{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"text\":\"Aerosol Products\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"We are a speciality aerosols products supplier in UAE with immense experience in serving the GCC market.Our optimal aerosol products are highly demanded owing to their quality, fragrance and long shelf life\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"Air Freshener- Designed with a secret formula, they are the perfect way to enhance the freshness of your interiors. They have the capacity to lift your mood and spread positivity. Available in various fragrance like jasmine, Oudh, lemon etc, they can neutralize any strong odours.\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"Polishes- Our furniture polish and steel polish range has been carefully selected to increase the sparkle and life of your equipment’s. It gives a protective coating to the surface which will dissolve in it.\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"Insect Killer- With our new range of insect killers, you can live in a hygiene environment. Its narrow nozzle helps you to reach in every hidden corner of your room and spray directly on insects, destroying them more efficiently. They are dermatologically tested safe for your hands.\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"All of our aerosol products are packed and sealed carefully to avoid spilling. Moreover, their special dispensing technology allows aerosol products to be dispensed cleanly and effectively from aerosol cans.\"}]',11,'2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('category:air-fresheners','category','air-fresheners','Air Fresheners','[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"Air fresheners are used to add fragrance to the air or mask odors, with the aim of creating a pleasant indoor atmosphere. Regardless of their purpose, air fresheners can emit and produce a variety of potentially harmful air contaminants that can contaminate the environment.\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"A whiff of fresh smelling air is perhaps all you want to make your room a pleasant space to occupy. You can make the whole space feel relaxing and uplifting with our range of air fresheners. These products can make the quality of air indoors better, thereby making your space an enjoyable and comfortable place to be in. Our air freshener product line contains amazing options with lighter and stronger notes. Always choose quality air fresheners/room fresheners for the most optimal experience. These are among the reasons why customers often consider us to be among the best air freshener suppliers.\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"text\":\"Office/Home fragrance products\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"Be it an office or your home, the main rooms should be well-maintained to offer the occupants a good time. This means it is just not enough to have a good-looking room, but it should make the occupants comfortable too. This is also why air freshener products are well-known accessories to use. With us, you can get fast-working and pleasant air fresheners to keep your office or residential space smelling fresh.\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"Air fresheners have been identified as a primary source of volatile organic compounds within buildings from an indoor air quality perspective. Air fresheners have been linked to adverse effects from a health perspective, such as migraine headaches, asthma attacks, mucosal symptoms, infant illness, and respiratory difficulty.\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":2,\"text\":\"Air Freshener suppliers in Dubai, UAE\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"At the Hygiene Link, we supply quality air freshener, a special design, a lacquered aluminum can, metal stems, a highly concentrated and durable fragrance that leaves a constantly cool atmosphere. Odor neutralizer with a strong air fragrance within 7–10 min. Create a variety of high-quality fragrances that create clean, fresh, hygienic, and comfortable fragrances. Metal valves are manufactured using a pharmaceutical valve technology for microscopic spray dispersion.\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"Hygiene Link is one of the leading Air Freshener suppliers in Dubai, UAE equipped with a team of dedicated people who are skilled and professional in their respective departments. We are the committed Air Freshener suppliers in Dubai, UAE for our customers and our passionate trust in developing the potential of our employees to benefit our customers and company.\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"text\":\"High Quality Air Freshener Suppliers in Dubai, UAE\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"Our highest priority is Hygiene Link. Our sales team will deal with all problems relating to your order and we will work together with our logistics team to find the optimal solution for your needs. In line with modern standards, we run the logistics system and thus allow quick and safe delivery channels. With sufficient resources, our logistics team can provide its customers with Hygiene Link, the best Air Freshener suppliers in Dubai, UAE, free of charge and subject to the invoice amount and ordered quantity, anywhere in the UAE in order to deliver their products.\"}]',12,'2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('category:car-care-products','category','car-care-products','Car care products','[{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"text\":\"Top-Quality and Best Car Cleaning Products\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"When it comes to car washing supplies and car cleaning supplies, there are a variety of products available in the market to help keep your vehicle looking its best. One such product is tyre polish, which is used to enhance the appearance of your tyres and protect them from damage.\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"If you are looking for a topnotch products then there are many wide variety of options. These suppliers offer a wide range of best car cleaning products, including tyre polishes, that are designed to meet the unique needs of vehicle owners in the region.\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"text\":\"Best and Affordable Car Cleaning Supplies\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"Hygiene Links is the best and affordable provider of car cleaning products.  When choosing a supplier in UAE, it\'s important to consider factors such as the quality of their products, their pricing, and their reputation in the market. Hygiene Links offers a premium range of car washing supplies and car cleaning supplies, manufactured using safe and highly effective ingredients, all tested for superior results.\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"text\":\"Top Car Washing Supplies: Beautify Your Car Care Routine with Quality Products\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"Buying best car cleaning products from trusted sources is important for several reasons. Here are some of the most compelling reasons why you should invest in car care products:\"},{\"type\":\"list-item\",\"text\":\"Protect your investment: A car is a significant investment, and taking care of it can help to protect its value. Regular cleaning, polishing, and maintenance can help to prevent damage and keep your car looking its best, which can be important if you plan to sell it or trade it in down the line.\"},{\"type\":\"list-item\",\"text\":\"Enhance safety: A clean car is not only more aesthetically pleasing, but it can also be safer to drive. Keeping your windows, mirrors, and headlights clean can help to improve visibility and reduce the risk of accidents on the road.\"},{\"type\":\"list-item\",\"text\":\"Improve performance:Regular maintenance, such as oil changes and tire rotations, can help to keep your car running smoothly and improve its overall performance. Using high-quality car cleaning supplies, such as fuel system cleaners and engine additives, can also help to improve fuel efficiency and reduce emissions.\"},{\"type\":\"list-item\",\"text\":\"Save money:Investing in car care products can actually save you money in the long run. Regular maintenance and cleaning can help to prevent costly repairs and prolong the life of your vehicle. Additionally, using high-quality car care products can help to reduce wear and tear on your car, which can help you avoid expensive repairs or replacement parts.\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"Buying car care products is an important part of owning a car. By investing in high-quality products and taking good care of your vehicle, you can help to protect your investment, improve safety and performance, and save money over time.\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"text\":\"What does a car care product contain?\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"The ingredients and components of best car cleaning products can vary depending on the specific product and its intended use. However, here are some common ingredients and components that you may find in car care products:\"},{\"type\":\"list-item\",\"text\":\"Surfactants: These are compounds that help to break down dirt and grime, making it easier to remove from your car\'s surface.\"},{\"type\":\"list-item\",\"text\":\"Solvents: These are liquids that help to dissolve grease, oil, and other stubborn stains that may be difficult to remove with water alone.\"},{\"type\":\"list-item\",\"text\":\"Polymers:These are substances that help to create a protective barrier on your car\'s surface, helping to repel water, dirt, and other contaminants.\"},{\"type\":\"list-item\",\"text\":\"Abrasives:These are substances that are used to remove scratches, stains, and other imperfections from your car\'s paint and other surfaces.\"},{\"type\":\"list-item\",\"text\":\"Waxes and sealants:These are products that are applied to your car\'s surface to create a protective layer that helps to prevent damage from UV rays, moisture, and other environmental factors.\"},{\"type\":\"list-item\",\"text\":\"Cleaners and degreasers: These products are designed to remove dirt, grime, and other contaminants from your car\'s exterior and interior surfaces.\"},{\"type\":\"list-item\",\"text\":\"Lubricants: These products are used to lubricate moving parts in your car\'s engine, transmission, and other mechanical systems.\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"text\":\"Top Benefits of Using Best Car Cleaning Products\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"Using best car cleaning products is essential for maintaining the appearance and performance of your vehicle. If you\'re looking for a reliable tyre polish supplier in Dubai, including tyre polish, there are many reasons why it\'s a good idea to invest in these products.\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"Firstly, car care products can help to protect your car\'s exterior from damage caused by environmental factors such as UV rays, salt, and pollution. This is especially important in Dubai, where high temperatures and harsh sunlight can take a toll on your car\'s paint and tyres. By using high-quality products such as tyre polish, you can help to protect your tyres from cracking and fading, and keep them looking their best.\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"Secondly, it can help to improve the safety and performance of your vehicle. Regular cleaning and maintenance can help to prevent problems such as rust, corrosion, and mechanical failures, which can be dangerous and costly to repair. By using products such as lubricants and fuel system cleaners, you can help to keep your car running smoothly and reduce the risk of breakdowns and accidents on the road.\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"Finally, using car care products can help to maintain the value of your vehicle. A well-maintained car is more likely to retain its resale value than one that is neglected and damaged. By investing in high-quality car care products, including tyre polish, you can help to keep your car looking its best and protect its value over time.\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"Hygiene Links is the leading suppliers of car cleaning supplies, offering premium car care products that effectively restore the black color of tires and provide long-lasting shine. As one of the best suppliers in GCC, we are a trusted dealer and distributor of high-quality car cleaning supplies, making sure your vehicle\'s tires maintain a sleek and well-maintained appearance.\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"Choose Hygiene Links which is your trusted partner for car washing supplies, car cleaning supplies, and the best car cleaning products in UAE.\"}]',24,'2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('category:cleaning-chemicals','category','cleaning-chemicals','Cleaning Chemicals','[{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"text\":\"Cleaning Chemical Supplier and Manufacturer in Dubai, UAE\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"Hygiene Links are the leading cleaning chemical supplier and manufacturer in Dubai, UAE. In the residential and commercial sectors, a safe and hygienic atmosphere is very necessary as it helps to protect people from different disease forms. A clean and healthy environment improves and enhances the overall look and comfort of the premises. All rooms, such as toilets, floors, kitchens, walls, doors, windows, tapestries, and electronic equipment require careful maintenance and cleaning. With this in mind, in 2005, we, Hygiene Link, began the business of manufacturing and supplying cleaning chemicals in Dubai, UAE.\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"level\":3,\"text\":\"Cleaning Chemicals Manufacturers in the Middle East\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"We deliver some of the finest cleaning products including cleaning chemicals across the United Arab Emirates and have long been serving clients from different industries. Are you searching for a quality cleaning chemical supplier and manufacturer in Dubai, UAE? If you are, look no further than Hygiene Links. We provide top-quality cleaning chemicals that will not cost you too much. So, when you are seeking quality cleaning products that do not break the bank, consider dealing with us as we have just thos