er in Muscat, Oman, quality is our first priority. That is why we provide glass wipers that are robust and that comply with international standards. Composed of high-quality materials from the available options, including sponge, our wipers make for a great janitorial experience without damaging or leaving water marks on the glass material. A set of these products will make it easier for you to remove stagnant water, stains and so forth from smooth surfaces.','import-cat-miscellaneous-products','/imported-products/floor-wiper.png','green',0,704,'2026-10-22 12:38:11','2026-10-22 12:38:11'),('import-cat-garbage-bags','Garbage Bags','garbage-bags','Garbage Bag Manufacturer in Muscat, Oman','import-cat-plastic-bags','/imported-products/garbage-bag-1.png','green',0,1002,'2026-10-22 12:38:11','2026-10-22 12:38:11'),('import-cat-garbage-bins','Garbage Bins','garbage-bins','HYGIENE LINKS is the most trusted garbage bin supplier in UAE and Oman, instrumental in offering top quality garbage bins to various industries. Our bins are manufactured using premium grade of raw materials and are stabilized. They come in various elegant colors and are easy to handle. Even though they are light weighted, they are strong and durable. Their installation and maintenance cost are affordable so can be used by anyone, anywhere.They are the right place to dispose off your waste….','import-cat-waste-management-products','/imported-products/ambience-series-blue.png','green',0,1701,'2026-10-22 12:38:12','2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('import-cat-glass-clothes','Glass Clothes','glass-clothes','','import-cat-tts-products','/imported-products/clean-glass-cloth-30-cm-pack-of-5-pieces.jpg','cyan',0,1508,'2026-10-22 12:38:12','2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('import-cat-gloves','Gloves','gloves','','import-cat-miscellaneous-products','/imported-products/cotton-gloves-dotted.png','green',0,705,'2026-10-22 12:38:11','2026-10-22 12:38:11'),('import-cat-green-organic-products','Green & Organic Products','green-organic-products','',NULL,'/imported-products/algaecide.jpg','blue',1,500,'2026-10-22 12:38:11','2026-10-22 12:38:11'),('import-cat-hand-brush','Hand Brush','hand-brush','','import-cat-brooms-and-mops','/imported-products/dish-wash-brush.jpg','green',0,202,'2026-10-22 12:38:11','2026-10-22 12:38:11'),('import-cat-hand-dryer-dispensers','Hand Dryer Dispensers','hand-dryer-dispensers','','import-cat-dispensers','/imported-products/hand-dryer-premium.jpg','green',0,402,'2026-10-22 12:38:11','2026-10-22 12:38:11'),('import-cat-hand-frame','Hand Frame','hand-frame','','import-cat-tts-products','/imported-products/applicator-with-velcro-frame-cm-40.jpg','cyan',0,1509,'2026-10-22 12:38:12','2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('import-cat-hand-sanitizer','Hand Sanitizer','hand-sanitizer','','import-cat-detergent-disinfectants','/imported-products/sanitizer-1.png','green',0,310,'2026-10-22 12:38:11','2026-10-22 12:38:11'),('import-cat-hand-sanitizer-dispenser','Hand Sanitizer Dispenser','hand-sanitizer-dispenser','Hand Sanitizer Dispenser Supplier in Muscat, Oman, UAE\n\nWe also serve as a hand sanitizer dispenser supplier in Muscat, Oman. We deal in an automatic dispenser from Purell, one of the best sanitization product manufacturers in the market. Our affiliation with Purell is among the factors that helps us stand out from the competition. It is a device that automatically dispenses sanitizer in a controlled quantity. You can fix it at a specific location and move it to another location according to your convenience. The demand for sanitizer dispensers has been growing thanks to the increased focus on sanitization and hygiene.\n\nThe product being automatic means that you only have to place your hands under the sensor, and it will dispense enough sanitizer onto the parts. This will reduce human touchpoints, which is a way to address different viruses. It is not hygienic to touch the same place repeatedly, and an automatic sanitizer dispenser solves that pain point.\n\nOur dispenser also comes with a superior storage capacity as compared to a conventional sanitizer bottle that you should replace or refill when you use up the sanitizer in it. The best machine can dispense it with hundreds of cycles without requiring a refill.\n\nYou can mount the dispenser on the wall or keep it on your table. Either way, you will keep it stationary, which means it will eliminate the hassles of determining the location of a misplaced sanitizer bottle. This feature makes the dispenser easier to use for people of all age groups. The dispenser has a stylish and sleek design as well. So, if you choose to install it at your location, you would give a premium vibe to the environment.\n\nThere are several other reasons to do business with a touch-free hand sanitizer dispenser supplier in Muscat, Oman.','import-cat-dispensers','/imported-products/purell-hand-sanitizer-dispenser.png','green',0,403,'2026-10-22 12:38:11','2026-10-22 12:38:11'),('import-cat-hand-soap','Hand Soap','hand-soap','Top High-Quality Hand Soap Manufacturers and Suppliers in Dubai, UAE\n\nHand hygiene is essential to stop the spread of germs and viruses. Using high-quality Liquid Soaps removes dirt and harmful bacteria effectively, ensuring a healthy and clean environment for both homes and workplaces in the UAE.\n\nHygiene Links stands as one of the leading hand soap manufacturers and liquid soap manufacturers in the UAE—delivering safe, effective, and skin-friendly hygiene products that meet modern cleanliness standards.\n\nOur soaps are made from essential fragrance oils rather than synthetic oils. The soaps not only smell good but also moisturize the skin easily.\n\nHow We Are The Trusted Hand Soap Suppliers And Manufacturers in UAE\n\nHygiene Links, a leading hand soap suppliers and manufacturers in UAE, is able to design products to suit your specific requirements, whether you\'re looking for innovative ingredients, cutting-edge technology, or the latest market trends. Always aware of our natural, custom made and environmentally sound origins, we stay consistent to our heritage and continue quality and hygienic products to guarantee that skin- and environmentally friendly products are supplied by us.\n\nOur commitment is reflected in our environmentally friendly packaging, sustainable raw material procurement and water and energy management as well as our focus on waste reduction.\n\nHand Soap Suppliers and Manufacturers in Dubai\n\nHygiene Links the top Soaps And Detergents Suppliers in UAE is proud to introduce our latest line of hand soap products, designed to help you maintain the highest standards of cleanliness and hygiene in your home or workplace. Our hand soap products are formulated using high-quality ingredients and are available in a range of fragrances and sizes to suit your specific needs.\n\nAs leading hand soap manufacturers we understand the importance of maintaining hygiene, especially in the current climate. Our hand soap products are carefully crafted to provide superior cleaning and protection against germs and bacteria, while also being gentle on your skin.\n\nOur Range of Hand Soap Products\n\nAt Hygiene Links, we are committed to providing our customers with the best possible products and services. Our team of experts is dedicated to ensuring that all of our hand soap products meet the highest standards of quality and efficacy. So, whether you\'re looking for hand soap for your home or business, you can trust Hygiene Links to deliver the best solutions for your needs.\n\nIf you\'re looking for hHand Soap Manufacturers and Suppliers in Dubai UAElook no further than Hygiene Links. Contact us today to learn more about our hand soap products and how they can help you maintain a safe and hygienic environment.\n\nWhy should you buy hand soap product?\n\nFirst and foremost, hand soap is essential for maintaining proper hand hygiene. Washing your hands with soap and water is one of the most effective ways to prevent the spread of germs and bacteria, which can cause illnesses such as colds, flu, and even COVID-19.\n\nSecondly, using hand soap regularly can help keep your skin clean and healthy. Good quality hand soap is formulated to remove dirt, grime, and bacteria from your skin, while also being gentle and moisturizing.\n\nFinally, investing in high-quality hand soap products from reputable hand soap suppliers and manufacturers like Hygiene Links can give you peace of mind, knowing that you are using a trusted product that is proven to be effective.\n\nIf you\'re looking for hand soap manufacturers and suppliers in Dubai, UAE look no further than Hygiene Links. Our range of hand soap products are carefully crafted to meet the highest standards of quality and efficacy, and are available in a range of fragrances and sizes to suit your specific needs. Contact us today to learn more about our hand soap products and how they can help you maintain a safe and hygienic environment.\n\nWhat Does a Hand Soap Product Contain?\n\nHand soap products typically contain a combination of ingredients that are designed to clean and protect your hands. These ingredients may vary depending on the specific product and the manufacturer, but here are some common components found in most hand soap products:\n\nSurfactants: These are the primary cleaning agents in hand soap products. They work by breaking down oils, dirt, and other substances on your skin, allowing them to be rinsed away. Moisturizers: Many hand soap products also contain moisturizing ingredients, such as glycerin, aloe vera, or vitamin E. These help to prevent your skin from drying out and becoming irritated from frequent hand washing. Fragrances: Most hand soap products have added fragrances to make them more appealing and pleasant to use. These can range from subtle scents to more intense fragrances. Preservatives: Hand soap products also contain preservatives to prevent the growth of bacteria and other microorganisms. Other ingredients: Some hand soap products may also contain additional ingredients, such as exfoliants, skin conditioners, or antibacterial agents.\n\nAs a trusted Hand Soap Manufacturers and Suppliers in Dubai UAE Hygiene Links uses only high-quality ingredients in our hand soap products. We understand the importance of maintaining proper hand hygiene and keeping your skin healthy, which is why our products are carefully formulated to meet the highest standards of quality and efficacy.\n\nContact us today to learn more about our hand soap products and how they can help you maintain a safe and hygienic environment.\n\nWhy Should You Use Hand Soap Products?\n\nUsing hand soap products is essential for maintaining proper hand hygiene and preventing the spread of germs and bacteria that can cause illnesses. Hand soap contains surfactants that break down dirt, oils, and other substances on your skin, allowing them to be rinsed away. Additionally, hand soap products often contain moisturizing ingredients, fragrances, and preservatives that help to protect and nourish your skin.\n\nRegular hand washing with soap and water is one of the most effective ways to prevent the spread of germs and bacteria, especially during cold and flu season or during a pandemic like COVID-19. By using hand soap products from trusted hand soap suppliers and manufacturers like Hygiene Links, you can be sure that you are using a quality product that is proven to be effective in maintaining proper hand hygiene\n\nIn summary, using hand soap products is crucial for protecting your health and preventing the spread of illness-causing germs and bacteria. As a leading Soaps And Detergents Suppliers in UAE, Hygiene Links is committed to providing high-quality hand soap products that meet the highest standards of quality and efficacy. Contact us today to learn more about our hand soap products and how they can help you maintain a safe and hygienic environment.','import-cat-detergent-disinfectants','','green',0,311,'2026-10-22 12:38:11','2026-10-22 12:38:11'),('import-cat-hard-brooms','Hard Brooms','hard-brooms','','import-cat-brooms-and-mops','/imported-products/coco-broom.png','green',0,203,'2026-10-22 12:38:11','2026-10-22 12:38:11'),('import-cat-hotel-supplies','Hotel Supplies','hotel-supplies','',NULL,'/imported-products/hygiene-kit.jpg','blue',1,600,'2026-10-22 12:38:11','2026-10-22 12:38:11'),('import-cat-hygiene-links-uv-protected-cable-ties','Hygiene Links UV protected Cable Ties','hygiene-links-uv-protected-cable-ties','','import-cat-miscellaneous-products','/imported-products/hygiene-links-uv-protected-cable-ties.jpg','green',0,706,'2026-10-22 12:38:11','2026-10-22 12:38:11'),('import-cat-insect-killer','Insect killer','insect-killer','Insect Killer Supplier','import-cat-aerosol-products','/imported-products/baygon.png','green',0,102,'2026-10-22 12:38:11','2026-10-22 12:38:11'),('import-cat-laundry-bags','Laundry Bags','laundry-bags','Laundry bag Manufacturer in Muscat, Oman','import-cat-plastic-bags','/imported-products/laundry-bag.jpg','green',0,1003,'2026-10-22 12:38:11','2026-10-22 12:38:11'),('import-cat-litter-picker','Litter Picker','litter-picker','','import-cat-miscellaneous-products','/imported-products/litter-picker.png','green',0,707,'2026-10-22 12:38:11','2026-10-22 12:38:11'),('import-cat-miscellaneous-products','Miscellaneous Products','miscellaneous-products','',NULL,'/imported-products/floor-wiper.png','blue',1,700,'2026-10-22 12:38:11','2026-10-22 12:38:11'),('import-cat-mop-buckets-trolley','Mop Buckets & Trolley','mop-buckets-trolley','',NULL,'/imported-products/janitorial-trolley-with-cover.png','blue',1,800,'2026-10-22 12:38:11','2026-10-22 12:38:11'),('import-cat-mop-wringers','Mop Wringers','mop-wringers','','import-cat-tts-products','/imported-products/tec-mop-wringer-green.jpg','cyan',0,1510,'2026-10-22 12:38:12','2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('import-cat-mops-and-clips','Mops and Clips','mops-and-clips','','import-cat-brooms-and-mops','/imported-products/dust-control-mopairport-