 supplier benefits','text',236,'2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('supplier_benefit_4_body','Benefit 4 description','We offer competitive pricing strategies, making high-quality cleaning products accessible and affordable for businesses of all sizes.','Home supplier benefits','textarea',239,'2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('supplier_benefit_4_title','Benefit 4 title','Competitive Pricing','Home supplier benefits','text',238,'2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('supplier_benefit_5_body','Benefit 5 description','Our flexible approach allows us to tailor solutions to your specific needs, ensuring maximum satisfaction and efficiency in your cleaning operations.','Home supplier benefits','textarea',241,'2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('supplier_benefit_5_title','Benefit 5 title','Customized Solutions','Home supplier benefits','text',240,'2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('supplier_closing_body_1','Closing paragraph 1','Diamond Capital Oasis strives to deliver high-quality cleaning services and cleaning supplies UAE & Oman. We pride ourselves in building relationships with our customers, by going the extra mile for them. We have always given the best service possible and we must have been doing something right, as some of our customers have been with us from the start.','Home supplier closing','textarea',251,'2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('supplier_closing_body_2','Closing paragraph 2','We are proud of our journey and excited about the future as we continue to provide top-quality products, innovative solutions, and exceptional service to businesses across various sectors. Contact us right away to avail the best cleaning products UAE & Oman.','Home supplier closing','textarea',252,'2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('supplier_closing_title','Closing section heading','Trusted Cleaning Equipment Supplier in UAE & Oman','Home supplier closing','textarea',250,'2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('supplier_intro_body','Supplier section introduction','At Diamond Capital Oasis, one of the best cleaning materials suppliers in UAE & Oman, we take pleasure in providing a wide range of goods that meet the specific demands of different sectors as a top manufacturer and distributor of cleaning and hygiene supplies. In addition to having a strong commitment to customer satisfaction and a desire to make a positive impact as cleaning products suppliers in UAE & Oman, our group has a family-friendly culture.','Home supplier introduction','textarea',201,'2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('supplier_intro_title','Supplier section heading','Trusted Cleaning Equipment Supplier in Dubai, UAE & Oman','Home supplier introduction','textarea',200,'2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('supplier_range_1_body','Range 1 description','Our selection of hand wash and sanitizers ensures the highest levels of hygiene in any setting.','Home cleaning product ranges','textarea',211,'2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('supplier_range_1_title','Range 1 title','Disinfectants and Sanitizers','Home cleaning product ranges','text',210,'2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('supplier_range_2_body','Range 2 description','Our assortment of cleaning solutions, which includes glass cleaners, degreasers, and all-purpose cleaners, guarantees complete and effective cleaning outcomes. In order to keep your pool in perfect shape, we also offer swimming pool chemicals.','Home cleaning product ranges','textarea',213,'2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('supplier_range_2_title','Range 2 title','Cleaning Chemicals','Home cleaning product ranges','text',212,'2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('supplier_range_3_body','Range 3 description','From hoover cleaners and scrubbers to mops and brooms, we provide a wide range of cleaning tools and equipment to help you clean effectively.','Home cleaning product ranges','textarea',215,'2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('supplier_range_3_title','Range 3 title','Cleaning Tools and Equipment','Home cleaning product ranges','text',214,'2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('supplier_range_4_body','Range 4 description','To safeguard the wellbeing of cleaning staff, we place a high priority on safety and provide a variety of personal protective equipment, such as gloves, masks, vests, helmets, and shoes.','Home cleaning product ranges','textarea',217,'2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('supplier_range_4_title','Range 4 title','Personal Protective Equipment','Home cleaning product ranges','text',216,'2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('supplier_range_5_body','Range 5 description','Trash bags, paper towels, and toilet tissues are examples of our disposable products that provide convenience and hygienic disposal methods.','Home cleaning product ranges','textarea',219,'2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('supplier_range_5_title','Range 5 title','Disposable Products','Home cleaning product ranges','text',218,'2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('supplier_range_6_body','Range 6 description','We offer products including floor polish, carpet cleaners, and stainless steel cleaners for specific cleaning requirements. These products produce remarkable results in a range of cleaning applications.','Home cleaning product ranges','textarea',221,'2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('supplier_range_6_title','Range 6 title','Specialized Cleaning Products','Home cleaning product ranges','text',220,'2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('supplier_range_7_body','Range 7 description','Our window cleaning products, which include microfiber cloths and wipers, guarantee consistently streak-free, spotless windows.','Home cleaning product ranges','textarea',223,'2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('supplier_range_7_title','Range 7 title','Window Cleaning Solutions','Home cleaning product ranges','text',222,'2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('supplier_range_body','Cleaning range introduction','We offer a comprehensive range of cleaning products UAE & Oman to cater to diverse cleaning requirements:','Home supplier introduction','textarea',203,'2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('supplier_range_title','Cleaning range heading','Our Range of Cleaning Products','Home supplier introduction','text',202,'2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('supplier_why_body','Why choose us introduction','As the cleaning equipments suppliers in UAE & Oman, we’re a cleaning company dedicated to providing its customers with quality service and making sure they’re completely satisfied with the results.','Home supplier benefits','textarea',231,'2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('supplier_why_title','Why choose us heading','Why Choose Diamond Capital Oasis?','Home supplier benefits','text',230,'2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('values_closing','Values closing','We look forward to serving you!','Vision & Mission page','text',148,'2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('values_commitment','Values commitment','Our group is dedicated and committed to providing our customers with the best quality products and services.','Vision & Mission page','textarea',147,'2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('values_statement','Values statement','Integrity, Excellence, diverse and strive to “walk the talk”','Vision & Mission page','textarea',146,'2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('vision','Vision statement','To be the Gulf’s most trusted one-stop partner for professional hygiene, facility care and customized product solutions.','About page','textarea',93,'2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('vision_mission_title','Vision and Mission page title','Vision & Mission','Vision & Mission page','text',140,'2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('vision_statement','Vision statement','Be the preferred versatile group that provides cost-effective and innovative products in Facilities and housekeeping, providing products and services to hospitality sector through professionalism and cohesiveness','Vision & Mission page','textarea',141,'2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('why_body','Why choose us description','Manufacturing strength, specialist sourcing and responsive support come together in one dependable supply relationship.','Home benefits','textarea',71,'2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('why_kicker','Why choose us kicker','WHY DIAMOND CAPITAL OASIS','Home benefits','text',69,'2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('why_title','Why choose us title','More than a supplier—your regional hygiene partner.','Home benefits','textarea',70,'2026-10-22 12:38:12');
