ch means that you need less product to achieve the same level of cleaning as traditional cleaning products. This can help schools save money on cleaning products in the long run. Eco-friendly chemical suppliers for school in UAE like Hygiene Links can help schools choose the right products that are effective and economical.','/imported-products/all-purpose-cleaner-1.jpg','','',0,1,'published',1220,'2026-10-22 12:38:12','2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('import-product-aluminium-handle-140-cm-blue','Aluminium Handle 140 cm (Blue)','aluminium-handle-140-cm-blue','OB001047','import-cat-tts-aluminium-handles','','','/imported-products/aluminium-handle-140-cm-blue.png','','Specification: H-140 cm\nUnit: Pieces',0,0,'published',2540,'2026-10-22 12:38:12','2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('import-product-aluminium-handle-140-cm-green','Aluminium Handle 140 cm (Green)','aluminium-handle-140-cm-green','OOOO1O47','import-cat-tts-aluminium-handles','Buy Aluminium Handle 140 Cm (Green) at the best price from Hygiene Links in UAE, Oman. Check out the website for more products and details.','Buy Aluminium Handle 140 Cm (Green) at the best price from Hygiene Links in UAE, Oman. Check out the website for more products and details.','/imported-products/aluminium-handle-140-cm-green.png','','Specification: H-14O cm\nUnit: Pieces',0,1,'published',2550,'2026-10-22 12:38:12','2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('import-product-aluminium-handle-140-cm-red','Aluminium Handle 140 cm (Red)','aluminium-handle-140-cm-red','OROO1O47','import-cat-tts-aluminium-handles','Buy Aluminium Handle 140 Cm (Red) at the best price from Hygiene Links in UAE, Oman. Check out the website for more products and details.','Buy Aluminium Handle 140 Cm (Red) at the best price from Hygiene Links in UAE, Oman. Check out the website for more products and details.','/imported-products/aluminium-handle-140-cm-red.png','','Specification: H-14O cm\nUnit: Piece',0,0,'published',2560,'2026-10-22 12:38:12','2026-10-22 12:38:12'),('import-product-aluminiu