cleaning cloth works on all polished surfaces, including mirrors, screens, and stainless steel, so you will find yourself reaching for this cleaning tool for all of your household and commercial cleaning needs! Product Specifications Material: 100% Microfiber Dimensions: 30 cm x 30 cm Pack Size: 5 pieces Color: White (or as per availability) Texture: Lint-free, ultra-soft for streak-free cleaning How to Use Use the cloth dry for light dusting or slightly dampened to tackle stubborn grime and fingerprints. Ideal for use without harsh chemicals, though it works perfectly alongside mild cleaning solutions. Wipe surfaces gently to achieve a streak-free, polished finish. Care and Maintenance Machine washable for repeated use and longevity. Wash with warm water and mild detergent. Avoid bleach and fabric softeners to preserve microfiber quality. Air dry or tumble dry on low heat to maintain softness and durability. Store in a clean, dry place away from lint-producing fabrics. Best Practices for Longevity To get the most out of your glass cleaning cloth, launder it separately from other fabric bits, particularly fuzzies which will ruin the effectiveness of the microfiber fabric. Keeping the cleaning cloth laundered regularly should maintain the effectiveness of the fibers to continue pulling away dust and dirt, so your glass will stay pristine. Order Your Glass Cleaning Cloth Pack Today! Try our high-performance glass cleaning cloth today! This pack of five is great for home and office use, and better yet, they are reusable for continued use. Order now to help you maintain your glass surfaces crystal clear! h1 { font-weight: 400; font-size: 2.5em; text-align: center; margin-top: 5rem; } ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; } ul .inner { padding-left: 1em; overflow: hidden; display: none; } ul li { margin: 0.5em 0; margin-left:0!important;padding-left:0!important; list-style:none!important; } ul li a.toggle { width: 100%; display: block; background: rgba(3,61,125); color: #fe